WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.420
Here's how to download ARY dramas for free with ARYPlusD. No sign-in, and no app.

2
00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:11.726
Open A R Y Plus D dot com in any browser, on your phone or computer.

3
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:19.086
Step one. Copy the episode link from ARY Plus, paste it in the box, and press Analyze.

4
00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:26.974
Step two. Every available quality appears, up to 4K Ultra HD, with the real file size.

5
00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:30.750
Tap the quality you want, then press Download.

6
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:36.186
Step three. Watch the live progress while your video is prepared.

7
00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.178
When it's ready, the MP4 is saved to your Downloads folder automatically.

8
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:47.328
Don't have a link? Switch to Search, and type the drama name.

9
00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.342
Pick the drama from the results.

10
00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.648
Every episode appears, with its thumbnail and length.

11
00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:59.270
Open an episode, choose a quality, and press Download.

12
00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:04.634
Start as many episodes as you like. Three download at the same time.

13
00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.842
Each one is saved to your device as soon as it's ready.

14
00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:15.212
Free, up to 4K, and no sign-in. Start now at A R Y Plus D dot com.
